{'symbol': 'DGX', 'date': '2021-05-20 16:10:00', 'title': 'QUEST DIAGNOSTICS DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': "SECAUCUS, N.J., MAY 20, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0QUEST DIAGNOSTICS\xa0(NYSE: DGX), THE WORLD'S LEADING PROVIDER OF DIAGNOSTIC INFORMATION SERVICES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF\xa0$0.62\xa0PER SHARE, PAYABLE\xa0ON\xa0JULY 21, 2021\xa0TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD OF\xa0QUEST DIAGNOSTICS COMMON STOCK ON\xa0JULY 7, 2021."}